      "type": "string",
      "string_value": "Get orders from the restaurants that still phone, picked from a guide in your own item numbers and prices. With VoiceOrder Solutions, each chef tells our app what the kitchen needs and reviews every item before it is sent. Conexiom keeps turning the POs your other customers email into ERP-ready orders."
